oshexed is an independent open-source editor for the Line 6 Helix. It is not
affiliated with, endorsed by or supported by Line 6 or Yamaha. "Line 6",
"Helix" and "HX Edit" are trademarks of their owners and are used only to
describe compatibility. The software contains no Line 6 code or data: it reads
model, preset and firmware data at runtime from the user's own files.
